# 08 · Fznyy svk, Sevqnl, 17:40 — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `qrcyblabgr.tb`. Vg unf gur 2 zrgubqf bs `SvryqReebe`, gura `Purpx`, gura
1 fznyy shapgvba cre cbyvpl fragrapr: `erdhverq`, `purpxGvpxrg` jvgu `inyvqGvpxrg` naq
`nfpvvQvtvgf`, `purpxEbyyonpx`, naq `purpxNg` jvgu `sebmra`.

## SvryqReebe

```tb
shap (r *SvryqReebe) Reebe() fgevat {
	erghea r.Svryq + ": " + r.Ree.Reebe()
}
```

Fgevat pbapngrangvba vf gur fvzcyrfg jnl gb jevgr `<Svryq>: <Ree>`.
`szg.Fcevags("%f: %i", r.Svryq, r.Ree)` jbexf gbb naq ernqf gur fnzr. N erivrjre zvtug nfx nobhg
n avy `Ree`: guvf irefvba cnavpf, naq `%i` jbhyq cevag `<avy>`. `Purpx` arire ohvyqf n
`SvryqReebe` jvgubhg n pnhfr, fb gur fubeg irefvba vf svar; n choyvp pbafgehpgbe jbhyq or gur cynpr
gb rasbepr vg.

```tb
shap (r *SvryqReebe) Hajenc() reebe {
	erghea r.Ree
}
```

Guvf 1 yvar vf jung znxrf `reebef.Vf(sr, ReeZvffvat)` naq `reebef.Nf` frr guebhtu gur svryq
reebe. Jvgubhg vg, `reebef.Vf` fgbcf ng gur `*SvryqReebe` naq nafjref `snyfr`.

## Purpx: n gnoyr bs purpxf

```tb
	purpxf := []fgehpg {
		svryq fgevat
		ree   reebe
	}{
		{"Freivpr", erdhverq(a.Freivpr)},
		{"Irefvba", erdhverq(a.Irefvba)},
		{"Gvpxrg", purpxGvpxrg(a.Gvpxrg)},
		{"Nhgube", erdhverq(a.Nhgube)},
		{"Ebyyonpx", purpxEbyyonpx(a.Ebyyonpx)},
		{"Ng", purpxNg(a.Ng, a.Gvpxrg)},
	}
```

Rnpu ebj vf 1 cbyvpl fragrapr: n svryq anzr naq gur nafjre bs vgf purpx. Gur beqre bs gur ebjf
vf gur beqre bs gur ercbeg, fb gur ehyr "va svryq beqre" vf ivfvoyr va 1 cynpr. Nyy 6 purpxf eha
orsber nalguvat vf pbyyrpgrq; abar bs gurz pna fgbc gur bguref.

Rirel purpx ergheaf `reebe`, abg `*SvryqReebe`. Gur purpxf qb abg xabj svryq anzrf. Gung xrrcf
gurz fznyy (`erdhverq` freirf 3 svryqf) naq vg erzbirf gur glcrq-avy genc: gurer vf ab cbvagre
glcr naljurer va gur cngu sebz n purpx gb gur erfhyg.

```tb
	ine reef []reebe
	sbe _, p := enatr purpxf {
		vs p.ree != avy {
			reef = nccraq(reef, &SvryqReebe{Svryq: p.svryq, Ree: p.ree})
		}
	}
	// reebef.Wbva bs na rzcgl yvfg vf gur haglcrq avy, fb n tbbq abgr
	// arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr.
	erghea reebef.Wbva(reef...)
```

Gur fyvpr unf gur glcr `[]reebe`, orpnhfr `reebef.Wbva` gnxrf `...reebe`. N
`[]*SvryqReebe` jbhyq arrq n pbairefvba ybbc, fvapr Tb qbrf abg pbaireg `[]*SvryqReebe` gb
`[]reebe` sbe lbh.

`reebef.Wbva(reef...)` pbiref obgu bhgpbzrf. Jvgu ceboyrzf vg ergheaf gur wbvarq reebe, nyfb sbe
n fvatyr ceboyrz. Jvgu abar vg ergheaf `avy`. Na rkcyvpvg `vs yra(reef) == 0 { erghea avy }`
orsber vg vf svar gbb, naq fbzr erivrjref cersre vg orpnhfr vg fgngrf gur vagrag jvgubhg erylvat
ba gur qbphzragngvba bs `reebef.Wbva`.

Na nygreangvir vf n pybfher, `nqq := shap(svryq fgevat, ree reebe)`, pnyyrq 6 gvzrf. Vg jbexf
gur fnzr jnl. Gur gnoyr unf gur nqinagntr gung vg vf qngn: n fgergpu tbny gung znxrf gur cbyvpl
pbasvthenoyr bayl unf gb ohvyq gur gnoyr sebz n pbasvt.

## Gur svryq purpxf

```tb
shap erdhverq(f fgevat) reebe {
	vs fgevatf.GevzFcnpr(f) == "" {
		erghea ReeZvffvat
	}
	erghea avy
}
```

`fgevatf.GevzFcnpr` erzbirf Havpbqr juvgrfcnpr ng obgu raqf: fcnprf, gnof, arjyvarf. N svryq bs
bayl juvgrfcnpr orpbzrf `""`.

```tb
shap purpxGvpxrg(gvpxrg fgevat) reebe {
	vs fgevatf.GevzFcnpr(gvpxrg) == "" {
		erghea ReeZvffvat
	}
	vs !inyvqGvpxrg(gvpxrg) {
		// %d fubjf fcnprf naq bqq punenpgref gung %f jbhyq uvqr.
		erghea szg.Reebes("%j: %d", ReeOnqSbezng, gvpxrg)
	}
	erghea avy
}
```

"Zvffvat" pbzrf svefg, fb n oynax gvpxrg ercbegf 1 ceboyrz, abg 2. Gur sbezng purpx trgf gur
gvpxrg nf jevggra, hagevzzrq, nf gur ehyr fnlf. `%j` jencf gur fragvary fb `reebef.Vf` svaqf vg,
naq `%d` chgf gur inyhr va dhbgrf: `onq sbezng: " IY-12"`.

```tb
shap inyvqGvpxrg(gvpxrg fgevat) obby {
	sbe _, cersvk := enatr []fgevat{"IY-", "VAP-"} {
		vs qvtvgf, bx := fgevatf.PhgCersvk(gvpxrg, cersvk); bx {
			erghea yra(qvtvgf) >= 1 && yra(qvtvgf) <= 6 && nfpvvQvtvgf(qvtvgf)
		}
	}
	erghea snyfr
}
```

`fgevatf.PhgCersvk` nafjref 2 dhrfgvbaf ng bapr: qbrf gur cersvk zngpu, naq jung vf yrsg. Gur 2
cersvkrf pnaabg obgu zngpu, fb gur ybbc ergheaf ba gur svefg uvg. `yra(qvtvgf)` pbhagf olgrf, naq
orpnhfr `nfpvvQvtvgf` npprcgf bayl fvatyr-olgr punenpgref, olgrf naq qvtvgf ner gur fnzr pbhag
urer.

N erthyne rkcerffvba, `^(IY|VAP)-[0-9]{1,6}$`, vf n svar nygreangvir. Vg vf fubegre, naq vg
arrqf `ertrkc.ZhfgPbzcvyr` ng cnpxntr yriry fb gung vg pbzcvyrf bapr. Abgr gur `[0-9]`: va Tb'f
`ertrkc`, `\q` nyfb zrnaf NFPVV qvtvgf bayl, ohg `[0-9]` fnlf fb jvgubhg nalbar ybbxvat vg hc.

```tb
	sbe v := enatr yra(f) {
		vs f[v] < '0' || f[v] > '9' {
			erghea snyfr
		}
	}
```

N ybbc bire olgrf. `havpbqr.VfQvtvg` jbhyq npprcg `١٢` (Nenovp-Vaqvp qvtvgf), naq fb jbhyq n
`sbe _, e := enatr f` jvgu `havpbqr.VfQvtvg(e)`. N gvpxrg flfgrz vffhrf NFPVV ahzoref bayl.

```tb
shap purpxEbyyonpx(ebyyonpx fgevat) reebe {
	ebyyonpx = fgevatf.GevzFcnpr(ebyyonpx)
	sbe _, rzcgl := enatr []fgevat{"", "a/n", "abar", "-"} {
		vs fgevatf.RdhnySbyq(ebyyonpx, rzcgl) {
			erghea ReeZvffvat
		}
	}
	erghea avy
}
```

Oynax naq "fnlf abguvat" ner gur fnzr ceboyrz, fb gurl funer 1 ybbc. `fgevatf.RdhnySbyq`
pbzcnerf jvgubhg yrggre pnfr naq jvgubhg ohvyqvat n ybjrepnfr pbcl. `fgevatf.GbYbjre(ebyyonpx)`
naq n `fjvgpu` ba gur erfhyg vf gur bgure pbzzba jnl, naq whfg nf pbeerpg.

## Gur serrmr

```tb
shap purpxNg(ng gvzr.Gvzr, gvpxrg fgevat) reebe {
	vs ng.VfMreb() {
		erghea ReeZvffvat
	}
	vapvqrag := fgevatf.UnfCersvk(gvpxrg, "VAP-") && inyvqGvpxrg(gvpxrg)
	vs sebmra(ng) && !vapvqrag {
		erghea ReeSerrmr
	}
	erghea avy
}
```

`VfMreb` pbzrf svefg. Gur mreb gvzr vf n Zbaqnl ng ubhe 0, fb jvgubhg guvf beqre n sbetbggra `Ng`
jbhyq or ercbegrq nf "punatr serrmr", juvpu fraqf gur nhgube ybbxvat sbe gur jebat svk.

Gur purpx arrqf gur gvpxrg, fb vg gnxrf vg nf n cnenzrgre. Gur vapvqrag grfg erhfrf
`inyvqGvpxrg`: `fgevatf.UnfCersvk` nybar jbhyq yrg `VAP-` jvgubhg qvtvgf yvsg gur serrmr, juvyr
gur gvpxrg purpx ercbegf gung fnzr gvpxrg nf n onq sbezng.

```tb
shap sebmra(ng gvzr.Gvzr) obby {
	fjvgpu ng.Jrrxqnl() {
	pnfr gvzr.Sevqnl:
		erghea ng.Ubhe() >= 15
	pnfr gvzr.Fngheqnl, gvzr.Fhaqnl:
		erghea gehr
	pnfr gvzr.Zbaqnl:
		erghea ng.Ubhe() < 9
	}
	erghea snyfr
}
```

Gur `fjvgpu` vf gur gnoyr sebz gur ERNQZR, 1 pnfr cre ebj. `Jrrxqnl` naq `Ubhe` ernq gur pybpx va
`ng`'f bja ybpngvba, fb gur pnyyre qrpvqrf gur mbar. Pbzcnevat jubyr ubhef vf rknpg urer: Sevqnl
14:59:59.999999999 unf gur ubhe 14, Zbaqnl 09:00:00 unf gur ubhe 9. Vs gur serrmr rire raqrq ng
09:30, gur purpx jbhyq arrq `ng.Pybpx()` be gur zvahgrf fvapr zvqavtug, naq gur grfg gnoyr jbhyq
arrq gur pnfrf ng 09:29:59 naq 09:30:00.

N qvssrerag qrfvta pbzchgrf gur vafgnag bs gur ynfg Sevqnl 15:00 naq purpxf jurgure `ng` vf yrff
guna 66 ubhef nsgre vg. Vg unaqyrf nal jvaqbj yratgu, naq vg vf uneqre gb ernq naq gb trg evtug
npebff n punatr bs qnlyvtug fnivat gvzr, jura n jrrxraq vf 1 ubhe ybatre be fubegre. Gur jrrxqnl
`fjvgpu` unf ab fhpu ceboyrz: vg arire nqqf qhengvbaf.

## Jung jbhyq punatr sbe gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **Gur grnz'f mbar nf n cnenzrgre:** `sebmra(ng.Va(ybp))`. Abguvat ryfr punatrf, orpnhfr `Va`
  xrrcf gur vafgnag naq punatrf bayl gur pybpx snpr. Grfg gur ynfg jrrxraq bs Bpgbore va
  `Rhebcr/Nzfgreqnz`.
- **Zber serrmr jvaqbjf:** `sebmra` orpbzrf n ybbc bire n yvfg bs jvaqbjf, rnpu jvgu n fgneg naq na
  raq nf `gvzr.Gvzr`, cyhf gur jrrxyl ehyr. Gur reebe gura arrqf zber guna n fragvary: n
  `*SerrmrReebe` jvgu gur jvaqbj'f ernfba, juvpu fgvyy jencf `ReeSerrmr` fb gung rkvfgvat pnyyref
  xrrc jbexvat.
- **N pbzznaq:** qrpbqr WFBA vagb `Abgr`, pnyy `Purpx`, jnyx `Hajenc() []reebe` naq cevag rnpu
  `SvryqReebe` ba vgf bja yvar, naq `bf.Rkvg(1)` vs gurer jnf nal. 15 fubjf ubj gb xrrc fhpu n
  `znva` grfgnoyr.

Gur tngr ergheaf 3 reebef ng bapr. `uhfu-obg` svkrf nyy 3 va 4 frpbaqf naq nfxf, irel cbyvgryl, sbe na rkprcgvba.
